<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Classification accuracy (<math id="S4.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> std) of <span id="S4.T3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5</span> on <span id="S4.T3.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CoLA</span> and <span id="S4.T3.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Yelp</span> datasets with varying training sizes <math id="S4.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="S4.T3.4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> For <span id="S4.T3.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoD</span> training data consists of <math id="S4.T3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k/2</annotation></semantics></math> standard and <math id="S4.T3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k/2</annotation></semantics></math> CFEs. Teacher model is <span id="S4.T3.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5-1.5B</span> and student model is <span id="S4.T3.4.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5-0.5B</span>. Refer to Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Additional Experiments and Details ‣ Few-Shot Knowledge Distillation of LLMs With Counterfactual Explanations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> for other datasets.</span></span></figcaption>
