<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="A3.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Classification accuracy (<math id="A3.T5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> std) across datasets with varying total training sizes <math id="A3.T5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A3.T5.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> For <span id="A3.T5.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoD</span>, training data consists of <math id="A3.T5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k/2</annotation></semantics></math> standard and <math id="A3.T5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k/2</annotation></semantics></math> CFEs. Teacher model <span id="A3.T5.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DeBERTa-v3-base</span> and student model <span id="A3.T5.4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DeBERTa-v3-xsmall</span></span></span></figcaption>
