Accuracy, runtime, and energy increases with <math id="A3.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>. LWD+<span id="A3.T8.3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoD</span> is consistently costlier due to intermediate representation alignment.</span></span></figcaption>
